NAME
     taskset - run a program on chosen processors

SYNOPSIS
     taskset MASK COMMAND [ARG...]

DESCRIPTION
     taskset runs COMMAND with its affinity set to MASK, a hexadecimal
     bitmap of harts: 1 is hart 0, 3 is harts 0 and 1, and so on. A
     thread only runs where its mask allows.

SEE ALSO
     nproc(1), nice(1), ps(1)
